    "description": "Applied Co.,Ltd. sells computers, peripherals, and digital products in Japan, Asia, and the United States. It operates in three segments: PC and Game Business; Cosmetics and Miscellaneous Goods Business; and Publishing and Advertising Business. The company engages in planning, development, and wholesale of private-branded PCs, games, home appliances, general merchandise, store equipment, cosmetics, and sundries, as well as provision of PC-related support services and contract software development. It is also involved in the manufacture and sale of HPC for research and development; web services and mail order site management; network system construction and maintenance; remote service business; AI solution and system development; and solutions sale for government agencies, research institutions, and universities. In addition, the company publishes information magazines and project books; plans, procures, and advertises products from manufacturers; and engages in event planning and management. Further, it manages specialty stores; and closed and cultural sites. The company was founded in 1977 and is headquartered in Fukuoka City, Japan."
